<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#FBFCFF">
    <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
    <title>Correction Requests | CampusLens</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="CampusPages.css">
</head>
<body class="campus-page" data-page="corrections">
    <div class="campus-shell">
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <a class="brand" href="Landing.html" aria-label="CampusLens home"><span class="brand-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 160 160" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="72" cy="72" r="48" stroke="#CDBCF6" stroke-width="6"/><path d="m106 106 26 26" stroke="#A8B7F0" stroke-width="11" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M72 43C54 43 45 57 45 75s12 33 27 33 27-14 27-33-9-32-27-32Z" stroke="white" stroke-width="4"/><circle cx="62" cy="70" r="3.5" fill="white"/><circle cx="82" cy="70" r="3.5" fill="white"/><path d="M64 85q8 7 16 0" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><span>Campus<span class="brand-light">Lens</span><small>STUDENT PORTAL</small></span></a>
            <div class="side-caption">WORKSPACE</div>
            <nav class="side-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
                <a href="History.html" class="nav-link"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg><span>Attendance history</span></a>
                <a href="Alerts.html" class="nav-link"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 7-3 9h18c0-2-3-2-3-9M10 21h4"/></svg><span>Alerts</span><span class="nav-count" data-unread-count>3</span></a>
                <a href="CorrReq.html" class="nav-link active" aria-current="page"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m16 4 4 4M4 20l4-.8L19 8a2.1 2.1 0 0 0-3-3L5 16l-1 4Z"/><path d="M12 20h8"/></svg><span>Correction requests</span></a>
            </nav>
            <div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="term-card"><div><strong>Fall semester</strong><span>2025 — 2026</span></div></div><div class="student-mini"><span class="avatar">AM</span><span><strong>Ahmed Mohamed</strong><small>Computer Science</small></span><span class="online-dot" aria-label="Online"></span></div></div>
        </aside>
        <main class="main-area">
            <header class="topbar"><div class="crumb"><span>Workspace</span><span class="crumb-slash">/</span><strong>Correction requests</strong></div><div class="top-actions"><span class="today-label" id="todayLabel">MONDAY, OCTOBER 20</span><a class="top-alert" href="Alerts.html" aria-label="Open alerts"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 7-3 9h18c0-2-3-2-3-9M10 21h4"/></svg><i></i></a><span class="avatar top-avatar">AM</span></div></header>
            <div class="page-content corrections-content">
                <section class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>WE’RE HERE TO HELP</div><h1>Correction requests</h1><p class="page-lede">Attendance doesn’t always go as planned. Let’s get your record right.</p></div><span class="heading-status"><span class="tiny-dot blue"></span><span id="pendingHeadingCount">1 pending review</span></span></section>
                <div class="correction-layout">
                    <section class="panel request-panel"><div class="panel-heading form-panel-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">NEW REQUEST</span><h2>Tell us what happened</h2><p>Share the class details and we’ll review your request.</p></div><span class="form-heading-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.1 2.1 0 0 1 3 3L8 18l-4 1 1-4Z"/></svg></span></div>
                        <form id="correctionForm" novalidate>
                            <div class="form-row"><label class="field-group" for="requestDate"><span>Class date <b>*</b></span><span class="field-control"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 10h18"/></svg><input id="requestDate" name="date" type="date" required><span class="field-error" id="dateError"></span></span></label><label class="field-group" for="requestCourse"><span>Course or class <b>*</b></span><span class="field-control"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 9 9-5 9 5-9 5-9-5Z"/><path d="M6 11v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5M21 9v6"/></svg><select id="requestCourse" name="course" required><option value="">Select a course</option><option value="Software Engineering">Software Engineering</option><option value="Database Systems">Database Systems</option><option value="Computer Networks">Computer Networks</option><option value="Artificial Intelligence">Artificial Intelligence</option><option value="Data Structures">Data Structures</option><option value="Other course">Other course</option></select><svg class="select-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"/></svg><span class="field-error" id="courseError"></span></span></label></div>
                            <fieldset class="field-group status-choice" id="statusChoice"><legend>Correct attendance status to <b>*</b></legend><div class="choice-row"><label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="status" value="present" required><span class="choice-check"></span><span class="choice-dot present-dot"></span><span>Present</span></label><label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="status" value="late"><span class="choice-check"></span><span class="choice-dot late-dot"></span><span>Late</span></label><label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="status" value="absent"><span class="choice-check"></span><span class="choice-dot absent-dot"></span><span>Absent</span></label></div><span class="field-error" id="statusError"></span></fieldset>
                            <label class="field-group" for="requestReason"><span>What should we know? <b>*</b></span><span class="field-control textarea-control"><textarea id="requestReason" name="reason" rows="4" maxlength="400" placeholder="Briefly explain why your attendance record needs an update..." required></textarea><span class="char-count"><span id="reasonCount">0</span>/400</span><span class="field-error" id="reasonError"></span></span></label>
                            <div class="form-hint"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 11v5M12 8h.01"/></svg>Your instructor will review this request. Please allow up to 48 hours.</div>
                            <button class="button button-primary submit-request" id="submitRequest" type="submit">Send correction request<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
                            <p class="form-feedback" id="formFeedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
                        </form>
                    </section>
                    <aside class="help-card"><span class="help-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>A fair review, every time.</h3><p>Your request is shared with the instructor for that class. Include a little context to help them make a quick decision.</p><div class="help-divider"></div><div class="help-tip"><span>01</span><p>Choose the date and class that need an update.</p></div><div class="help-tip"><span>02</span><p>Explain what happened in a few clear words.</p></div><div class="help-tip"><span>03</span><p>Check back here for a status update.</p></div><a href="Alerts.html" class="help-link">How updates reach you <span>↗</span></a></aside>
                </div>
                <section class="panel requests-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Your requests</h2><p>Track previous attendance updates</p></div><span class="records-pill"><span class="tiny-dot blue"></span><span id="requestTotalCount">3</span> total</span></div><div class="request-list" id="requestList"></div><div class="notification-empty" id="requestsEmpty" hidden><span class="empty-icon">✦</span><h3>No correction requests yet</h3><p>Requests you submit will appear here.</p></div></section>
                <div class="demo-note"><span>ⓘ</span> Requests are stored in this browser for demonstration. A real approval workflow needs a university backend.</div>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>
    <script src="CampusPages.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
